<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Guía interactiva: codificación de caracteres en localización</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        .bit-switch {
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .bit-switch.active {
            background-color: #4F46E5;
            color: white;
            border-color: #4F46E5;
        }
        .byte-card {
            min-width: 120px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }
        .bit-data { color: #4F46E5; font-weight: bold; }
        .bit-control { color: #9ca3af; }
        .table-big td, .table-big th { padding: 1.25rem 1rem; }
        
        /* Estilo neutral para botones de decisión */
        .btn-decision {
            background-color: white;
            border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
            color: #4b5563;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-decision:hover {
            border-color: #4f46e5;
            color: #4f46e5;
            background-color: #eef2ff;
        }
    </style>
    <!-- Chosen Palette: Warm Neutrals & Professional Indigo -->
</head>
<body class="bg-stone-50 text-stone-800 font-sans leading-relaxed text-base">

    <nav class="bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between h-16">
                <div class="flex items-center">
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-700">LocCode<span class="text-stone-500 text-sm font-normal ml-2">guía para traductores</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-8 items-center text-sm font-medium">
                    <button onclick="scrollToSection('intro')" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-indigo-600">Inicio</button>
                    <button onclick="scrollToSection('bits')" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-indigo-600">Bits y bytes</button>
                    <button onclick="scrollToSection('standards')" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-indigo-600">Estándares</button>
                    <button onclick="scrollToSection('simulator')" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-indigo-600">Mojibake</button>
                    <button onclick="scrollToSection('solution')" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-indigo-600">Soluciones</button>
                    <button onclick="scrollToSection('escaping')" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-indigo-600">Código</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 space-y-24">

        <!-- 1. Introducción -->
        <section id="intro" class="text-center py-10">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6">El ADN del texto digital</h1>
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
                <p class="text-xl text-stone-600 text-center">
                    Para un ordenador, las palabras no existen; solo existen interruptores encendidos o apagados. El problema es que cada sistema de lectura interpreta esos interruptores de forma distinta.
                </p>
                <p class="text-stone-500 italic text-lg text-center">
                    Entender cómo se organizan estos datos es la única forma de evitar que tus traducciones se conviertan en basura digital.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4">
                <button onclick="scrollToSection('simulator')" class="bg-indigo-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-indigo-700 transition shadow-lg font-medium">
                    Simular un error de lectura
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Laboratorio de bits y bytes -->
        <section id="bits" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-10 border border-stone-100">
            <div class="mb-8 border-b border-stone-100 pb-6 text-center lg:text-left">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-stone-800 mb-3">Laboratorio de bits: la unidad mínima</h2>
                <p class="text-stone-600 text-lg">
                    Un <strong>byte</strong> es un paquete de 8 interruptores. Al combinarlos, generas un número decimal. Ese número es la «dirección» donde el ordenador busca cada letra.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="flex justify-center space-x-2" id="bit-container"></div>
                    <p class="text-center text-sm text-stone-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Toca los bits para cambiar el valor</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-indigo-100 shadow-inner">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-center md:text-left">
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-xs uppercase text-indigo-600 font-bold mb-2">Valor decimal</span>
                            <span id="decimal-display" class="block text-5xl font-mono font-bold text-indigo-900">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-xs uppercase text-indigo-600 font-bold mb-2">Código hexadecimal</span>
                            <span id="hex-display" class="block text-5xl font-mono font-bold text-emerald-700">00</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-indigo-200">
                        <span class="block text-xs uppercase text-indigo-600 font-bold mb-3 text-center">Lo que procesa el hardware (binario)</span>
                        <div class="flex justify-center font-mono text-2xl tracking-[0.5em] text-indigo-950 bg-white/50 py-2 rounded-lg" id="binary-display-formatted">
                            0000 0000
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Gran tabla técnica -->
        <section id="standards" class="space-y-10">
            <div class="max-w-4xl text-center lg:text-left">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-stone-800 mb-4">Análisis técnico: comparación de bits por estándar</h2>
                <p class="text-stone-600 text-lg">
                    Fíjate en cómo los caracteres básicos (A, a) coinciden siempre. Sin embargo, en los caracteres propios de cada lengua, <strong>UTF-8</strong> fragmenta el valor original. Al comparar <strong>ANSI</strong> con <strong>UTF-8</strong>, verás que el valor real se preserva, aunque repartido.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200">
                <table class="w-full text-left table-big">
                    <thead class="bg-indigo-900 text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="border-b border-indigo-800">Carácter</th>
                            <th class="border-b border-indigo-800">ASCII (7 bits)</th>
                            <th class="border-b border-indigo-800">ANSI (Win-1252)</th>
                            <th class="border-b border-indigo-800">Unicode (UTF-8)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-100 text-sm">
                        <tr class="hover:bg-stone-50 transition">
                            <td class="font-bold text-3xl text-center bg-stone-50">A</td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">x41 (65)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-data">01000001</span></div>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">x41 (65)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-data">01000001</span></div>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-indigo-600 font-bold text-base">x41 (65)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-control">0</span><span class="bit-data">1000001</span></div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-stone-50 transition">
                            <td class="font-bold text-3xl text-center bg-stone-50">a</td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">x61 (97)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-data">01100001</span></div>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">x61 (97)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-data">01100001</span></div>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-indigo-600 font-bold text-base">x61 (97)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-control">0</span><span class="bit-data">1100001</span></div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-stone-50 transition">
                            <td class="font-bold text-3xl text-center bg-stone-50 text-indigo-600 italic">¿</td>
                            <td class="text-red-400 italic">No existe</td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-indigo-600 font-bold text-base">xBF (191)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-data">10111111</span></div>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-indigo-600 font-bold text-base">xC2 xBF</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400 leading-tight">
                                    B1: <span class="bit-control">110</span><span class="bit-data">00010</span> / B2: <span class="bit-control">10</span><span class="bit-data">111111</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-indigo-400 mt-1 italic">191 repartido en dos bytes</div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-stone-50 transition">
                            <td class="font-bold text-3xl text-center bg-stone-50 text-indigo-600 italic">ñ</td>
                            <td class="text-red-400 italic">No existe</td>
                            <td>
                                <div class="font-mono text-indigo-600 font-bold text-base">xF1 (241)</div>
                                <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400">Bits: <span class="bit-data">11110001</span></div>
                            </td>
